    "body": "Did my own pass to tweak some things and constify others.\r\n\r\nMy remaining questions:\r\n\r\n- Should we try to switch validator to conformance checker, throughout?\r\n- Should we keep the legacy questions section, or no? Especially the internet explorer question is pretty silly. The 2022 question does have some historical value though. I wonder if it should be moved back into its original location and trimmed a bit instead?\r\n\r\nOK to merge either way, although please feel free to review my changes too.",
